<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>毕业 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%AF%95%E4%B8%9A/</link><description>Recent content in 毕业 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%AF%95%E4%B8%9A/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>毕业与就业</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/graduation-and-career/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/graduation-and-career/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;毕业前最后半年要同时推三件事：&lt;strong&gt;修完学分、找工作、处理身份&lt;/strong&gt;。三件事任何一件拖到最后都会出事，而且顺序上互相牵连——&lt;strong&gt;找工作的时间线由招聘季决定，不是由你的毕业时间决定&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>